scenario 2
tick_rate 60
# Level 36 (Catacombs 3), door class 16 at (22790, 8210). The player arrives from the west and
# stops diagonally next to the door (2 sub-tiles on both axes). The door's own cells carry the
# door collision bit, so the reach line to it must not count them as a blocker: the click opens
# the door.
name a1-catacombs-diagonal-door
seed 1
end 700
allow stuck
char class 3
char level 20
char area 0 36
at 0 dev god on
at 1 dev kill level
at 2 check unit(object,16).mode_id == 0
at 10 input clickunit 2 16
at 300 check unit(object,16).mode_id != 0
